<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .hero-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 80px 0;
        }
        .doc-card {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .doc-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .doc-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .redoc-color { color: #8cc8ff; }
        .json-color { color: #ff6b6b; }
        .production-notice {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ee5a5a 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero-section text-center">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">
                <i class="fas fa-book-open"></i>
                AmexingWeb API Documentation
            </h1>
            <p class="lead">
                Comprehensive documentation for the AmexingWeb PCI DSS compliant e-commerce platform API
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4">
                <span class="badge bg-success me-2">
                    <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> PCI DSS 4.0.1 Compliant
                </span>
                <span class="badge bg-info me-2">
                    <i class="fas fa-lock"></i> Secure
                </span>
                <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">
                    <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> High Performance
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <% if (isProduction) { %>
    <div class="production-notice">
        <div class="container">
            <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle fa-2x mb-3"></i>
            <h3>API Documentation Not Available</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
                API documentation is disabled in production for security compliance (PCI DSS 4.0.1).
                <br>
                Please access documentation in the development environment.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                <div class="card doc-card h-100 text-center p-4">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <i class="fas fa-book doc-icon redoc-color"></i>
                        <h3 class="card-title">API Documentation</h3>
                        <p class="card-text">
                            Interactive API documentation powered by Redocly with detailed descriptions,
                            request/response examples, and comprehensive endpoint information.
                        </p>
                        <a href="<%= apiDocsUrl %>" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                            <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i>
                            Open API Docs
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                <div class="card doc-card h-100 text-center p-4">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <i class="fas fa-file-alt doc-icon json-color"></i>
                        <h3 class="card-title">OpenAPI Specification</h3>
                        <p class="card-text">
                            Download the complete OpenAPI 3.0 specification in JSON format
                            for code generation, testing tools, and API client development.
                        </p>
                        <a href="<%= specJsonUrl %>" class="btn btn-danger btn-lg" download>
                            <i class="fas fa-download"></i>
                            Download JSON
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mt-5">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                        <h4 class="mb-0">
                            <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
                            Getting Started
                        </h4>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h5><i class="fas fa-key text-warning"></i> Authentication</h5>
                                <p>This API uses JWT Bearer tokens for authentication. Include your token in the <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code> header.</p>

                                <h5><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-success"></i> Security</h5>
                                <p>All endpoints enforce HTTPS in production and include comprehensive security headers for PCI DSS 4.0.1 compliance.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h5><i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt text-info"></i> Rate Limiting</h5>
                                <p>API endpoints are rate-limited to prevent abuse. Check response headers for rate limit information.</p>

                                <h5><i class="fas fa-terminal text-secondary"></i> Code Samples</h5>
                                <p>The API documentation includes code samples in cURL and JavaScript for quick integration.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mt-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card border-info">
                    <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">
                        <h5 class="mb-0">
                            <i class="fas fa-terminal"></i>
                            Development Commands
                        </h5>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <code class="d-block mb-2">yarn docs:api:bundle</code>
                                <small class="text-muted">Bundle modular OpenAPI spec</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <code class="d-block mb-2">yarn docs:api:lint</code>
                                <small class="text-muted">Lint spec for errors</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mt-3">
                                <code class="d-block mb-2">yarn docs:api:preview</code>
                                <small class="text-muted">Preview with hot reload (port 8080)</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mt-3">
                                <code class="d-block mb-2">yarn docs:api:stats</code>
                                <small class="text-muted">Show specification statistics</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-4 mt-5">
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2025 AmexingWeb. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>
                <i class="fas fa-code"></i>
                Built with Express.js, Parse Server, and Redocly
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
